OL,3,AGraduate job vacancies drop by almost
OL,4,A50% in a year, survey suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of graduate jobs has fallen
OL,7,Falmost in half in the past year,
OL,8,Faccording to new figures, as employers
OL,9,Fcut entry-level roles in favour of AI
OL,10,Fand battle rising costs.
OL,12,FJobs website Adzuna said it had just
OL,13,F8,383 graduate vacancies listed in
OL,14,FJuly, down from 15,397 at the same
OL,15,Fpoint last year.
OL,17,FAdzuna also found competition among job
OL,18,Fseekers across all levels is rising,
OL,19,Fwith an average of 2.14 job seekers per
OL,20,Fvacancy in July, up from 1.93 a year
OL,21,Fearlier.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
