OL,3,AGraduate job vacancies drop by almost
OL,4,A50% in a year, survey suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, some have said the data might
OL,7,Fnot be reflective of the whole graduate
OL,8,Fjob market and may instead suggest a
OL,9,Fshift in the way the roles are
OL,10,Fadvertised.
